trap-artifact: caught by debugger emitted a trap or breakpoint call, exit 1
trap-oracle: caught by exit codes differ, exit 1
javascript-dropped: caught by JavaScript kept 0 debugger statements, exit 1
lowering-dropped: caught by JavaScript kept 0 debugger statements, exit 1
debugger-refused: caught by refuses debugger, exit 1
flow-instruction: caught by debugger changed the flow: 2 instructions, exit 1
